<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">

<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>{{statusCode}} — HTTP 305</title>
    <link rel="manifest" href="/manifest.json">
    <meta name="theme-color" content="#153a59">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/theme.css">
    <style>
        .card {
            text-align: center;
        }

        .error-code {
            font-size: 96px;
            font-weight: 800;
            color: var(--warn);
            margin: 24px 0 8px;
            line-height: 1;
            letter-spacing: -2px;
            opacity: 0.85;
        }

        .tagline {
            font-size: 20px;
            font-weight: 600;
            margin: 0 0 16px;
        }

        .message {
            font-size: 15px;
            color: var(--text-muted);
            line-height: 1.6;
            margin: 0 0 20px;
            max-width: 420px;
            margin-left: auto;
            margin-right: auto;
        }

        .upstream-url {
            display: block;
            font-size: 13px;
            color: var(--text-muted);
            background: var(--bg);
            border: 1px solid var(--border);
            border-radius: var(--radius);
            padding: 10px 14px;
            margin: 0 auto 24px;
            max-width: 420px;
            word-break: break-all;
            text-align: left;
        }

        .upstream-url .label {
            display: block;
            font-size: 11px;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            letter-spacing: 0.5px;
            color: var(--warn);
            margin-bottom: 4px;
            font-weight: 600;
        }

        @media (max-width: 480px) {
            .error-code {
                font-size: 72px;
            }
        }
    </style>
</head>

<body>
    <div class="card">
        <div class="logo">
            <h1>HTTP <span>305</span></h1>
        </div>

        <div class="error-code">{{statusCode}}</div>
        <p class="tagline">{{statusText}}</p>
        <span class="badge badge-warn">Upstream Error</span>
        <p class="message">
            This error came from the website you're trying to visit &mdash; not from HTTP 305.
            The upstream server responded with <strong>{{statusCode}} {{statusText}}</strong>.
        </p>

        <div class="upstream-url">
            <span class="label">Upstream URL</span>
            {{url}}
        </div>

        <a href="/" class="btn">302 Me Home</a>

        <div class="footer">
            <p>Status 305: Use Proxy &bull; Status {{statusCode}}: Upstream said no</p>
        </div>
    </div>
</body>

</html>
